# #Reclamation Project - messages from the spell kit (MagicSpellKitSystem).
magic-ward-blocked = A shimmering ward swallows the spell!
magic-condition-faded = The magic on you fades.
magic-conjured = It forms in your hands out of thin air.
magic-dodged = You twist aside, as if you knew it was coming!
magic-hex-fail = Your magic sputters and dies. You are hexed!
magic-weakness-fail = Your limbs feel like lead. The attack goes nowhere.
magic-muted-cant-cast = Your mind is locked. You can't form the words.
magic-needs-dead = That only works on the dead.
magic-needs-max-mana = You need at least { $mana } max mana to cast this.
magic-shadow-step-light = Too bright there. Shadows only.
magic-swap-nobody = There's nobody near them to swap with.
magic-tracked = They are to the { $dir }, about { $meters } m away.
magic-read-mind = { $name }: { $job }, { $state }.
magic-read-mind-nojob = no clear purpose
magic-diagnose-healthy = No injuries.
magic-diagnose-bleeding = bleeding
magic-sense-none = You sense no other minds nearby.
magic-sense-minds = { $count } minds nearby: { $where }.
magic-unbind-done = The bond to your grimoire snaps. It belongs to no one now.
magic-unbind-none = You have no bound grimoire.
magic-resurrect-too-hurt = The body is too broken to hold life. Heal it first.
magic-resurrect-done = A gasping breath! They live again!
magic-memory-wipe = Your head feels hollow. You can't remember the last five minutes.
magic-psychometry-none = The item tells you nothing.
magic-psychometry = Fingerprints linger on it: { $prints }
magic-inscription-need-book = You must hold your own grimoire.
magic-inscription-done = The grimoire crumbles to ash as { $count } spells burn into your mind.
magic-transmute-done = The material shifts and changes in your hands.
magic-transmute-nothing = Nothing you're holding can be changed this way.
magic-duplicate-done = A perfect copy forms beside the original.
magic-duplicate-nothing = Nothing you're holding can be copied.
magic-forge-done = The weapon glows white-hot, then settles. It feels deadlier.
magic-forge-nothing = You need to hold a melee weapon that hasn't been forged yet.
magic-forged-name = arcane { $name }
magic-msg-whisper = A voice that isn't yours whispers inside your skull...
magic-msg-dread = A cold terror grips you. Something is watching.
magic-msg-nightmare = Whispers claw at your mind! Your hands won't stop shaking!
magic-msg-panic = Run. RUN!
magic-msg-storm = The world splinters into screaming colours!
magic-msg-terror = Your skin crawls and glows. You feel like a ghoul.
magic-msg-ticking = Tick... tick... tick... something is ticking inside your head!
magic-implant-1 = I have always loved the smell of Nuka-Cola in the morning.
magic-implant-2 = The Brotherhood stole my toaster and I want it back!
magic-implant-3 = I am secretly a synth. Beep boop.
magic-implant-4 = Has anyone seen my mole rat? His name is Gerald.
magic-implant-5 = War... war never changes. Unlike my socks.
magic-implant-6 = I think the radroaches are planning something.
magic-mishap-limb = You arrive... but your { $part } didn't come with you!
magic-mishap-organ = Something inside you stayed behind. Your { $part } is lying where you left!
